{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NET.CRAWL</strong> is a deck-building puzzle roguelike played on a hexagonal grid. Moving into a hex(node) activates it and triggers its effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/4d8f8dc6552bd13c4cf89f0af37ab7fd.poster.avif?t=1773169503\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/4d8f8dc6552bd13c4cf89f0af37ab7fd.webm?t=1773169503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/4d8f8dc6552bd13c4cf89f0af37ab7fd.mp4?t=1773169503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue nodes give you Data. Yellow nodes - Credits.<br>Green nodes are your personal toolbox, with effects ranging from basic defense to creative rule bending.<br>Red nodes are hostile. They will cause you all sorts of trouble. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/e71e27529d654812242bed95f7d284bf.poster.avif?t=1773169503\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/e71e27529d654812242bed95f7d284bf.webm?t=1773169503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/e71e27529d654812242bed95f7d284bf.mp4?t=1773169503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there are the purple ones. <strong>The Cores.</strong> Mini-bosses, each with its own unique ability or victory condition. They are very powerful, almost game-breaking. You won't be able to defeat them without a tailored strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/e9e5e0b18b08eb7d9ea684abe3c5dfff.avif?t=1773169503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras_big/e9e5e0b18b08eb7d9ea684abe3c5dfff.avif?t=1773169503 width=1560 height=888 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nodes of all types are mixed together to create levels with endless opportunities for combos and synergies. Each level is dynamically assembled from two grids (blue and green) that you draft as part of between-level progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/da21cfc2d2b089c0b57805373ee87b11.poster.avif?t=1773169503\" width=1170 height=1090 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/da21cfc2d2b089c0b57805373ee87b11.webm?t=1773169503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958140/extras/da21cfc2d2b089c0b57805373ee87b11.mp4?t=1773169503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Avalanche","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958140/8fa729d4dbc620e596dc652c04ee08e668aa32c3.jpg"},{"name":"Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958140/2892b54b3af465170d8cdf43e541e92aff441155.jpg"},{"name":"Freeze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958140/fcb131ba85fef3c9e4071a4a008e3063ab5b61c9.jpg"},{"name":"Split","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958140/1bff063a33fe